CivilKit Calcs is a derivative of CalcpadCE (https://github.com/imartincei/CalcpadCE).

Upstream versions this work tracks (CalcpadCE's own version is recorded here, apart from the
CivilKit Calcs version in Cargo.toml):
  web frontend:  8.0.0-beta3-preview (Calcpad.Web/frontend, imported with changes into web/)
  engine:        ported from commit 0cf438f (calcpad-core, calcpad-highlighter, calcpad-docx)

The Rust code (formerly named calcpad-rs) is a port of the CalcpadCE calculation engine
(https://github.com/imartincei/CalcpadCE, ported from commit 0cf438f).

The original C# code is distributed under the MIT License:

